WEBVTT

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:15.115
My right hand
holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:19.920
And my left holds
one of silver.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.057
Never one
without the other,

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:37.204
Two unseen bowls
for each of us.

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:45.612
The golden one
is filled with joy,

00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:53.020
shining warmly.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:57.758
Since we met,
my golden bowl

00:00:57.825 --> 00:01:04.698
cannot hold all my
happiness and love.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:14.909
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:22.183
I would leave
my past behind...

00:01:22.183 --> 00:01:26.988
For you, for the
sake of love,

00:01:26.988 --> 00:01:33.928
I would empty the
bowls of my past.

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:41.602
Based on the manga by the beloved
Ikeda Riyoko

00:02:05.526 --> 00:02:07.195
See you later!

00:02:11.732 --> 00:02:13.534
What's she wearing today?

00:02:13.534 --> 00:02:15.470
A purple dress...

00:02:15.537 --> 00:02:17.405
She's going to a lot of effort...

00:02:17.472 --> 00:02:19.074
Yes. Wearing something
different every day...

00:02:20.408 --> 00:02:24.679
It's been one week. So, I'd like
to start out by telling you...

00:02:25.413 --> 00:02:28.950
...about my "rotation"
for this week:

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:36.758
Monday... a long tailored jacket
with a pleated skirt.

00:02:37.292 --> 00:02:42.430
Tuesday... on open-collared blouse
with a cardigan, both beige.

00:02:42.764 --> 00:02:46.301
Wednesday... a traditional single
jacket-suit.

00:02:46.902 --> 00:02:50.772
Thursday... the uniform.
And Friday, a cobalt green dress.

00:02:51.173 --> 00:02:53.041
But this no more than a plan, you know.

00:02:53.575 --> 00:02:57.178
Depending upon my mood, I may
change the "rotation".

00:02:57.979 --> 00:03:01.183
Brother... The cherry
blossoms are gone now...

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.585
There are so many fresh
green leaves on the trees!

00:03:03.919 --> 00:03:09.391
2. The Glass Slippers

00:03:10.526 --> 00:03:11.326
Another letter...
<b> </b>

00:03:11.393 --> 00:03:12.060
Another letter...
What?

00:03:12.127 --> 00:03:14.596
The letter! Aren't you still
sending letters to your boyfriend?

00:03:14.663 --> 00:03:17.399
No, he's not my boyfriend,
he's my brother!

00:03:17.466 --> 00:03:19.535
Same difference.

00:03:19.601 --> 00:03:23.072
No, a brother is a brother!

00:03:23.405 --> 00:03:24.606
I don't understand...

00:03:24.673 --> 00:03:26.342
Well, you don't have to.

00:03:26.408 --> 00:03:30.346
Well, my brother is
noisy and obnoxious.

00:03:30.412 --> 00:03:32.615
Oh, but I'm sorry...

00:03:32.681 --> 00:03:34.750
Your dear brother is different...

00:03:34.817 --> 00:03:35.951
Oh, leave me alone!

00:03:36.552 --> 00:03:38.621
But, my brother,
she's right...

00:03:39.021 --> 00:03:42.824
You are neither my
boyfriend nor my brother.

00:03:43.825 --> 00:03:46.028
But on that day...

00:03:46.095 --> 00:03:48.030
...the first snowfall
of the season...

00:03:48.697 --> 00:03:52.968
I thought you were someone I could
not live without....

00:03:53.903 --> 00:03:56.572
OK everyone, you have 5 minutes to complete this quiz.

00:04:00.976 --> 00:04:02.044
All right!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:06.449
You had been teaching
us at cram school

00:04:06.515 --> 00:04:09.184
for the past four weeks.

00:04:10.253 --> 00:04:12.988
It was your last day...

00:04:16.325 --> 00:04:19.395
It wasn't love...

00:04:19.996 --> 00:04:21.330
Surely it wasn't love...

00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:26.001
When the last day came,

00:04:26.536 --> 00:04:29.138
...and I realized that I might never
see you again...

00:04:29.872 --> 00:04:33.943
I just felt that I couldn't
let you slip away.

00:04:35.878 --> 00:04:38.147
I didn't want you
to be like all the rest

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.349
...entering my life
and then leaving.

00:04:40.816 --> 00:04:44.353
I couldn't let that
happen. I just couldn't!

00:04:46.355 --> 00:04:49.358
Those eyes, those brown eyes -- they
somehow reflected my childhood days...

00:04:49.759 --> 00:04:53.229
Maybe it was those mysteriously shining
brown eyes that attracted me to you!

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:56.098
That's not love...

00:04:56.298 --> 00:04:57.566
...surely it's not...

00:05:02.038 --> 00:05:04.974
A question? Sure,
On which page?

00:05:09.111 --> 00:05:11.047
Please! Be my brother!

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:12.515
Your brother?!?

00:05:12.782 --> 00:05:14.650
I won't bother you!

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:18.187
Just read...
please just read my letters!

00:05:19.055 --> 00:05:20.523
Now hold on...

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:23.660
And it would be great if
you could write to me too...

00:05:23.727 --> 00:05:26.196
I mean, if you have the time...

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:27.864
Now, look...

00:05:27.864 --> 00:05:32.468
No! You don't even have to write to me! Just read
my letters, that would be more than enough! Really!

00:05:32.935 --> 00:05:34.003
Believe me...

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.807
I don't know how I got the courage
to do such a thing!

00:05:38.141 --> 00:05:40.877
Ummm... your name is...?

00:05:41.411 --> 00:05:43.212
Misonoo Nanako.

00:05:43.813 --> 00:05:45.081
What? Misonoo?

00:05:45.348 --> 00:05:49.018
Are you the daughter of Professor
Misonoo of Jyoto University?

00:05:49.018 --> 00:05:51.354
What's keeping
you, Henmi, let's go!

00:05:51.354 --> 00:05:53.823
It's snowing harder and harder.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:57.360
Sorry - just a minute...

00:06:00.764 --> 00:06:02.966
Do you know my father?

00:06:04.367 --> 00:06:08.505
Yes... no... I mean, well, I've
read a couple of his books...

00:06:12.642 --> 00:06:13.843
Here's my address...

00:06:14.378 --> 00:06:15.379
So...?!

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:18.982
So that means...?

00:06:19.849 --> 00:06:23.053
OK... but I'll expect the first letter to tell me
that you got into the High School.

00:06:23.853 --> 00:06:24.854
O... Ok!

00:06:25.522 --> 00:06:26.723
Bye...

00:06:29.059 --> 00:06:31.661
Brother... brother...

00:06:33.463 --> 00:06:36.466
the warm feeling
of that word...

00:06:37.334 --> 00:06:40.670
I've been so longing for that feeling
since childhood!

00:06:41.805 --> 00:06:43.006
My brother...

00:06:43.807 --> 00:06:48.812
I felt that it became
mine at that moment.

00:06:55.218 --> 00:06:57.621
[Seiran School, next stop.]

00:07:14.838 --> 00:07:17.508
Oh, Tomoko! Listen!
Next Sunday...

00:07:17.508 --> 00:07:19.777
My mother is going to
let us use the kitchen!

00:07:19.844 --> 00:07:23.914
Really? That's great! What's
our challenge this time?

00:07:23.914 --> 00:07:25.315
A chocolate cake!

00:07:25.315 --> 00:07:29.253
Sounds good! With rum,
nuts, and dried fruit!

00:07:29.253 --> 00:07:32.056
And fluffy whipped cream!

00:07:32.056 --> 00:07:34.191
And decorated with mint leaves!

00:07:34.191 --> 00:07:37.928
That's perfect! That
sounds wonderful!

00:07:38.529 --> 00:07:40.664
We'll go dutch!

00:07:45.736 --> 00:07:46.937
Good morning!

00:07:47.338 --> 00:07:48.606
Nanako-san!

00:07:50.274 --> 00:07:51.742
Oh! Good morning...

00:07:51.742 --> 00:07:55.413
I've been calling you
- didn't you hear me?

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.481
Do you always come
to school at this time?

00:07:57.481 --> 00:07:58.215
Yes...

00:07:58.215 --> 00:08:00.551
I'll make sure I'm here
to meet you, then.

00:08:02.687 --> 00:08:03.821
Excuse me...

00:08:05.423 --> 00:08:06.757
Let's hurry up!

00:08:06.757 --> 00:08:10.561
The first class is Mrs.
Imai's. She's always early.

00:08:12.496 --> 00:08:14.365
Hmmph! "excuse" you!

00:08:16.033 --> 00:08:20.905
How pretty! Today's dress looks
really nice on you, Misonoo-san!

00:08:22.306 --> 00:08:24.642
Good morning, big sisters!

00:08:24.976 --> 00:08:25.710
Hi...!
<b> </b>

00:08:25.776 --> 00:08:27.512
Hi...!
Good morning, pussy-cat!

00:08:28.045 --> 00:08:29.113
"Pussy-cat"?

00:08:41.592 --> 00:08:43.728
The bell is ringing!

00:08:43.928 --> 00:08:45.863
Hurry! Take your seats!

00:08:45.863 --> 00:08:47.665
...so anyway...
Yes, what then?

00:08:47.665 --> 00:08:50.535
Come on! You two,
take your seats!

00:08:51.002 --> 00:08:53.805
You look so pretty
when you are angry!

00:08:53.872 --> 00:08:56.608
Lucky you! Being scolded
by Kaoru-no-Kimi...

00:08:56.674 --> 00:08:58.676
Please, scold me too!

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.685
You, could you please move...

00:09:08.086 --> 00:09:10.155
I'd like to sit there.

00:09:10.488 --> 00:09:11.890
What? Why?

00:09:12.824 --> 00:09:16.895
No big deal - I just want
to sit next to Misonoo-san.

00:09:18.163 --> 00:09:19.698
What the heck...?

00:09:19.764 --> 00:09:22.167
What's going on over there?

00:09:22.434 --> 00:09:25.236
Quiet! Hurry! Hurry up!

00:09:25.236 --> 00:09:27.973
Here, take your things...

00:09:29.641 --> 00:09:35.447
[One of the most interesting ways to get
to London is through the Soviet Union.]

00:09:35.514 --> 00:09:38.651
[Of course, this country
has its problems.]

00:09:38.717 --> 00:09:41.253
[So you may have problems too.]

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:46.926
[However, I prefer to think of them
not as problems, but as adventures.]

00:09:47.659 --> 00:09:49.995
I'm so happy I get
to sit next to you...

00:09:51.329 --> 00:09:52.464
Brother...

00:09:53.131 --> 00:09:55.267
...regarding Mariko-san...

00:09:55.867 --> 00:09:58.003
ever since orientation,
I've been thinking

00:09:58.003 --> 00:10:00.339
that there was something different
about Mariko's face.

00:10:01.006 --> 00:10:02.274
I finally realized...

00:10:02.407 --> 00:10:05.477
...that it's her lips.
Her very red lips...

00:10:07.079 --> 00:10:09.414
So, why are you looking
at me that way...

00:10:09.414 --> 00:10:12.351
Oh! Your lips... your lips...

00:10:13.085 --> 00:10:14.219
Oh, them?

00:10:20.559 --> 00:10:21.760
I'll show you.

00:10:22.895 --> 00:10:23.829
Look.

00:10:25.097 --> 00:10:28.901
I constantly bite my lips like this.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:34.974
...because the big
sisters like red lips.

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.041
What?

00:10:38.043 --> 00:10:44.516
So that... anyway, never mind...
Perhaps you'd like to try it?

00:10:48.454 --> 00:10:50.122
No... I couldn't!

00:10:54.193 --> 00:10:57.596
What a gorgeous,
but pushy girl!

00:10:57.596 --> 00:10:59.399
And, somehow,
also, mysterious...

00:10:59.465 --> 00:11:03.335
Shinobu Mariko-san
is so full of surprises.

00:11:19.285 --> 00:11:20.486
Please, how much is this?

00:11:27.293 --> 00:11:29.028
That's true...

00:11:29.362 --> 00:11:31.497
it's a big deal in my family

00:11:31.497 --> 00:11:36.702
since my mother was also
a Seiran Sorority member.

00:11:36.702 --> 00:11:40.306
Wow - a mother and daughter
both in the Seiran Sorority!

00:11:40.306 --> 00:11:42.642
Well, I haven't been chosen yet.

00:11:42.642 --> 00:11:44.243
Oh, it's a sure thing, though.

00:11:44.243 --> 00:11:47.313
Well, I already begged
my father until he let me

00:11:47.313 --> 00:11:50.049
get the dress made for
the final selection party.

00:11:50.049 --> 00:11:51.117
See!

00:11:57.724 --> 00:11:59.726
Here, Nanako-san...!

00:12:06.466 --> 00:12:07.667
Finally, today...!

00:12:07.667 --> 00:12:08.601
What?

00:12:08.668 --> 00:12:10.403
Why, the Sorority of course!

00:12:10.737 --> 00:12:12.605
Today's the day,
during 5th period,

00:12:12.605 --> 00:12:14.274
that they'll announce
the candidates.

00:12:15.208 --> 00:12:17.277
That's why Misaki was
talking about that...

00:12:17.944 --> 00:12:19.279
Misaki Aya?

00:12:19.612 --> 00:12:22.682
Unfortunately, she's probably
one of the top candidates.

00:12:24.217 --> 00:12:25.952
I don't like her.

00:12:26.686 --> 00:12:27.821
Don't say such things!

00:12:28.755 --> 00:12:30.757
But I hate her, I really hate her.

00:12:31.157 --> 00:12:35.295
I've had to put up with her being
in my classes since Junior High!

00:12:35.629 --> 00:12:36.763
She's such a bitch.

00:12:41.501 --> 00:12:43.637
What do you think?

00:12:43.637 --> 00:12:44.437
About what?

00:12:44.838 --> 00:12:48.642
About me! Do you
think I'll be selected?

00:12:48.775 --> 00:12:53.246
Well... I don't know much
about the Sorority...

00:12:54.715 --> 00:12:57.250
Actually, I'm quite sure of it...

00:12:58.652 --> 00:13:00.253
Sorority membership...

00:13:01.121 --> 00:13:05.525
Only the chosen few
get to be in the club.

00:13:06.059 --> 00:13:09.062
Mariko-san and Misaki-san have been
so pre-occupied...

00:13:09.796 --> 00:13:14.001
Before I came to Seiran, I didn't even
know sororities existed.

00:13:14.001 --> 00:13:15.802
This is a new world for me.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.340
But now that I know
more about them...

00:13:21.008 --> 00:13:23.410
...I wonder if they are
really such a good idea.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.288
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:13:39.627 --> 00:13:41.161
She saw me...

00:13:41.762 --> 00:13:42.830
...but she didn't
even recognize me.

00:13:48.502 --> 00:13:50.304
She must have
forgotten already.

00:13:52.306 --> 00:13:55.042
What's the matter?
Fifth period is starting...

00:13:58.846 --> 00:14:01.582
Saint-Juste-sama!
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:14:04.251 --> 00:14:05.920
Thank you for this.

00:14:07.121 --> 00:14:08.989
Oh, OK. I see that you're
as popular ever.

00:14:08.989 --> 00:14:10.991
Still, I'm no "Kaoru-no-Kimi"...

00:14:13.594 --> 00:14:15.062
That's for sure.

00:14:19.867 --> 00:14:23.070
Your taste in clothing is no
better than before, I see...

00:14:23.537 --> 00:14:26.474
I don't have bourgeois
tastes like you.

00:14:26.741 --> 00:14:28.809
"Classy" is the term I prefer.

00:14:29.143 --> 00:14:31.145
What great pot-shots!
<b> </b>

00:14:31.145 --> 00:14:33.014
What great pot-shots!
They're beautiful!

00:14:33.214 --> 00:14:35.883
Back in the basketball club?

00:14:35.883 --> 00:14:37.552
Yes.

00:14:37.552 --> 00:14:38.953
What's so great about and dust?

00:14:38.953 --> 00:14:41.155
That's my business... not yours.

00:14:43.224 --> 00:14:44.358
Later then...

00:14:44.358 --> 00:14:45.560
See ya.

00:14:49.297 --> 00:14:50.965
Get out of my way.

00:14:59.707 --> 00:15:00.975
As you wish...

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.515
The Sorority has arrived!

00:15:09.117 --> 00:15:10.718
Finally, it's time!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:19.861
Everyone, quiet please.

00:15:24.866 --> 00:15:29.871
I would now like to announce the names
of the candidates for Seiran Sorority.

00:15:31.873 --> 00:15:34.276
Please, would those ladies whose names
I call be so kind as to come forward..

00:15:37.479 --> 00:15:39.014
Shinobu Mariko-san...

00:15:39.881 --> 00:15:40.815
Here!

00:15:44.286 --> 00:15:47.489
Great! Congratulations!
I knew you could do it!

00:15:47.689 --> 00:15:50.158
I'm still just a candidate.

00:15:50.492 --> 00:15:51.159
Now...
<b> </b>

00:15:51.159 --> 00:15:51.960
Now...
Coming!

00:15:56.631 --> 00:15:57.899
And next...
<b> </b>

00:15:57.899 --> 00:16:00.102
And next...
Orihara Kaoru-san

00:16:03.705 --> 00:16:05.774
Please come forward.

00:16:07.109 --> 00:16:09.978
Thank you, but I decline.

00:16:12.247 --> 00:16:15.450
What is that? State your reason...

00:16:16.518 --> 00:16:19.388
I'm opposed to the very
existence of the Sorority itself.

00:16:42.344 --> 00:16:45.481
But since it's not
"politically correct"...

00:16:46.215 --> 00:16:49.551
...to say that I'm opposed to
the existence of this Sorority.

00:16:49.551 --> 00:16:53.889
let me just say instead that
it's because of my poor health.

00:16:54.757 --> 00:16:55.758
I see...

00:16:56.825 --> 00:16:58.894
I'm sorry to hear that.

00:16:58.894 --> 00:17:01.697
But thank you for stating
your opinion so honestly.

00:17:19.515 --> 00:17:23.386
Now, the final candidate
from this class...

00:17:27.123 --> 00:17:28.925
Misonoo Nanako-san!

00:18:04.494 --> 00:18:06.362
This is impossible!

00:18:06.362 --> 00:18:07.830
I can't agree with this!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:09.232
It's not fair!

00:18:11.968 --> 00:18:14.838
Wait! Why isn't it fair?

00:18:14.838 --> 00:18:16.306
It should be obvious!

00:18:16.306 --> 00:18:18.775
How is Misonoo Nanako
qualified for the Sorority?

00:18:19.576 --> 00:18:20.443
That's right!

00:18:20.443 --> 00:18:22.112
Misaki is right!

00:18:24.714 --> 00:18:26.983
So you think YOU'RE qualified?

00:18:26.983 --> 00:18:29.719
Shut-up! You, the daughter
of a pornography writer!

00:18:39.729 --> 00:18:42.198
Wha.. What are you saying!

00:18:42.465 --> 00:18:44.801
Ever since we were in Junior High,

00:18:44.801 --> 00:18:47.137
I've known that Shinobu Hisaki

00:18:47.137 --> 00:18:49.739
is your father, and
he's a porn writer!

00:18:53.009 --> 00:18:55.946
Everyone knew that!

00:18:55.946 --> 00:18:59.483
We pretended as if we didn't
know because we pitied you!

00:19:03.553 --> 00:19:06.223
Damn you!
Damn you!
Damn you!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:09.092
Even if your family's
school endowment is huge,

00:19:09.092 --> 00:19:11.495
you're still not qualified
for the Sorority,

00:19:11.495 --> 00:19:15.098
and neither is Misonoo Nanako!

00:19:23.907 --> 00:19:25.375
That's enough.

00:19:25.842 --> 00:19:29.446
It would be nice if
it were otherwise,

00:19:29.446 --> 00:19:32.316
but children cannot
choose their parents.

00:19:37.654 --> 00:19:38.655
Shinobu-san!

00:19:41.725 --> 00:19:44.128
Oh sister, I'm cursed!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:50.000
Don't fret, it's ok.
It's not your fault.

00:19:50.401 --> 00:19:51.869
Our selection...

00:19:52.269 --> 00:19:55.339
Do you still oppose the
fairness of our selection?

00:19:58.609 --> 00:19:59.810
It's unfair!

00:20:00.945 --> 00:20:05.349
Then I can let you be a candidate as
a replacement for Orihara Kaoru.

00:20:06.817 --> 00:20:12.223
However, my one veto vote will
guarantee that you won't be selected.

00:20:20.364 --> 00:20:21.699
Misaki!

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:27.171
Every year, it turns
into a fight like this!

00:20:27.705 --> 00:20:29.907
From competition comes strength.

00:20:30.508 --> 00:20:33.511
Being able to survive
this competition

00:20:33.511 --> 00:20:36.047
is itself a qualification
for being selected.

00:20:47.792 --> 00:20:48.926
Misonoo-san...

00:20:50.595 --> 00:20:51.395
Yes?

00:20:52.196 --> 00:20:55.133
The final selection party is
being held at noon this Sunday.

00:20:55.133 --> 00:20:57.001
At the Sorority House.

00:20:57.602 --> 00:21:00.071
Here. This the invitation.

00:21:04.008 --> 00:21:05.209
My Dear Brother...

00:21:13.151 --> 00:21:14.552
Misonoo-san!

00:21:16.487 --> 00:21:17.622
Miso... Oh!

00:21:19.424 --> 00:21:21.226
Hi, Nanako!

00:21:21.359 --> 00:21:25.096
You're late! I've waited
for over 20 minutes!

00:21:33.304 --> 00:21:36.307
That was quite a scene!

00:21:36.307 --> 00:21:39.044
The whole class went crazy
over those announcements!

00:21:42.247 --> 00:21:43.248
What's the matter?

00:21:47.118 --> 00:21:48.253
I don't believe it!

00:21:50.855 --> 00:21:52.457
No way! Why?

00:21:52.457 --> 00:21:56.728
I don't know! But
along with Shinobu...

00:21:57.996 --> 00:21:58.997
It's true then.

00:21:59.865 --> 00:22:00.599
So now?
<b> </b>

00:22:00.599 --> 00:22:01.466
So now?
What?

00:22:02.067 --> 00:22:03.068
What are you going to do now?
<b> </b>

00:22:03.068 --> 00:22:05.070
What are you going to do now?
Well... ummm...

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:07.339
I think I have to attend the party...

00:22:10.142 --> 00:22:13.211
That's next... That's next Sunday!

00:22:13.546 --> 00:22:14.079
Yes...
<b> </b>

00:22:14.146 --> 00:22:15.147
Yes...
But the cake!

00:22:16.682 --> 00:22:18.817
We were supposed to bake
the cake next Sunday

00:22:21.019 --> 00:22:22.154
I'm sorry!

00:22:22.421 --> 00:22:23.822
I'm sorry, Tomoko!

00:22:24.556 --> 00:22:29.027
Don't worry. I'm sure
I won't be selected.

00:22:29.561 --> 00:22:30.896
I'm so sorry, Tomoko.

00:22:40.506 --> 00:22:42.241
I'm sorry, too.

00:22:43.575 --> 00:22:46.311
My little Nanako has become
such a Cinderella-Princess.

00:22:46.311 --> 00:22:49.314
Let's show them they
made a good choice!

00:22:51.116 --> 00:22:52.184
Tomoko...

00:23:08.067 --> 00:23:12.404
Let's go home. The main
gate will be closed soon.

00:23:13.739 --> 00:23:14.740
Misaki-san?

00:23:17.276 --> 00:23:18.677
I can't...

00:23:19.612 --> 00:23:24.016
I just can't let
everything end like this...

00:23:32.625 --> 00:23:33.693
My Dear Brother...

00:23:37.563 --> 00:23:40.566
The Cinderella-Princess
dropped her glass slippers

00:23:40.566 --> 00:23:44.103
and became her everyday self when
the clock struck twelve.

00:23:45.371 --> 00:23:48.708
When will the clock
strike twelve for me?

00:24:09.462 --> 00:24:13.666
I dreamed I was
chasing a rainbow...

00:24:13.733 --> 00:24:19.205
Then the rainbow I
was chasing was you.

00:24:20.607 --> 00:24:24.811
Before, I had no
strength, no will.

00:24:24.811 --> 00:24:30.283
But now because
of you, I do.

00:24:30.950 --> 00:24:36.623
Feelings of love,
like raindrops

00:24:36.623 --> 00:24:42.028
Come pouring
from the sky.

00:24:42.028 --> 00:24:44.831
This is surely a game

00:24:44.831 --> 00:24:47.634
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:47.634 --> 00:24:50.036
Always dancing,

00:24:50.036 --> 00:24:55.175
Always capricious...

00:25:01.648 --> 00:25:06.853
The other girls react adversely to
Nanako's selection to the sorority..

00:25:06.853 --> 00:25:09.322
...and a slanderous note
is posted in response.

00:25:09.723 --> 00:25:12.392
The day before the selection party,
Nanako receives a phone call

00:25:12.392 --> 00:25:17.064
from someone claiming
to be Miya-sama

00:25:17.798 --> 00:25:18.665
Next episode:
<b> </b>

00:25:18.665 --> 00:25:20.534
Next episode:
Nanako is Disqualified?

00:25:20.934 --> 00:25:22.536
Brother, Dear Brother...
<b> </b>

00:25:22.536 --> 00:25:25.939
Brother, Dear Brother...
There is no end to my tears...
